[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11460.469, "timestamp": "03:11:00", "text": "务必小心。你必须立即"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.03, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "指出这一点，否则它就会直接扔掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11465.51, "timestamp": "03:11:05", "text": "你以大约200公里/小时的速度落入水中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11473.83, "timestamp": "03:11:13", "text": "啊，速度从零飙升到350到400公里/小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11490.309, "timestamp": "03:11:30", "text": "现在，他们过去的做法是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11493.59, "timestamp": "03:11:33", "text": "过去曾利用蒸汽压力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11496.15, "timestamp": "03:11:36", "text": "现在他们开始做科幻题材的作品了。他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11499.349, "timestamp": "03:11:39", "text": "使用电磁轨道炮。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11501.11, "timestamp": "03:11:41", "text": "你的飞机基本上是被击落的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11508.07, "timestamp": "03:11:48", "text": "还，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.309, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "你想出了一个解释为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11515.309, "timestamp": "03:11:55", "text": "枪支能够发射。对齐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.83, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "大概"}]